---
description: Releases must be validated and project documentation must remain synchronized
alwaysApply: true
---

Before declaring a release ready:
- verify tests/security/migrations/API/runtime
- review Docker/IaC when present
- update PROGRESS.md
- update PROJECT_STATE.md for durable architectural state
- update ADRs for material architecture decisions
- prepare rollback and post-release verification
- never invent changelog items
